- Oh my God.

00:00:19.480 --> 00:00:20.313
- I thought we were

00:00:20.313 --> 00:00:21.231
- What?
- trying one.

00:00:21.231 --> 00:00:22.064
- Oh my God.

00:00:22.064 --> 00:00:23.974
(upbeat jazz music)

00:00:23.974 --> 00:00:26.177
- Ooh, it's in a mystery cup.

00:00:26.177 --> 00:00:27.895
- Oh it smells sweet.

00:00:27.895 --> 00:00:28.742
- Cheers.

00:00:28.742 --> 00:00:29.672
- Mmm.

00:00:29.672 --> 00:00:30.872
