00:00:59.052 --> 00:00:59.920
(buzzer buzzes)

00:00:59.920 --> 00:01:01.403
(slide whooshes)
(upbeat piano music)

00:01:01.403 --> 00:01:02.318
- Enticing.

00:01:02.318 --> 00:01:04.703
