00:01:48.957 --> 00:01:50.121
(slide whooshes)
(upbeat music)

00:01:50.121 --> 00:01:51.271
- Do you know what this smells like?

00:01:51.271 --> 00:01:53.968
Icing on a beautiful cinnamon cake.

00:01:53.968 --> 00:01:55.049
- It's tangy.

00:01:55.049 --> 00:01:56.457
- There's definitely more coffee

00:01:56.457 --> 00:01:57.585
than there is
- Yeah.

00:01:57.585 --> 00:01:58.856
- pumpkin spice.

00:01:58.856 --> 00:02:00.103
- I can keep drinking it.

00:02:00.103 --> 00:02:01.879
Not going out on a limb
and sayin' I'd get a venti,

00:02:01.879 --> 00:02:03.538
but I'd definitely smash a grande.

00:02:03.538 --> 00:02:04.829
- Dude, this is good.

00:02:04.829 --> 00:02:06.164
- This one's not good, not bad.

00:02:06.164 --> 00:02:07.371
I'm happy.

00:02:07.371 --> 00:02:10.242
- Coffee, pump, pump,
sugar, pump, pump, coffee.

00:02:10.242 --> 00:02:11.463
